  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic. In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak. In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic and lemon pepper seasoning, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt. Stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b7f5ad8e6534c49273/step-cc714500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Slice tomato into thin wedges.\n• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b7f5ad8e6534c49273/step-b21de110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b7f5ad8e6534c49273/step-93617320.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove pan from heat and add the honey, tossing haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b7f5ad8e6534c49273/step-26871530.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium bowl, combine cucumber, tomato, spinach and rocket mix, a drizzle of the vinegar and olive oil. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b7f5ad8e6534c49273/step-52fa3440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide herby rice, honey haloumi and cucumber salad between bowls.\n• Crumble fetta cubes over salad. Top with babaganoush to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80b7f5ad8e6534c49273/step-acb90f50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
